<title>USA: Lehman Brothers Holdings to issue debt.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers Holdings to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc will issue $250 million in seven-year debt, said Lehman Brothers, the underwriter for the deal.</p>
<p>The issue is expected to be noncallable for life.</p>
<p>Unofficial price talk on the issue is seen between 78 to 80 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, dealers said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
